{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1555768-using-magic-through-media","id":1555768,"title":"Using Magic Through media","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-11-22T14:55:07-08:00","id":1555768,"title":"Using Magic Through media","content":"Ok, I'll try to be short: <br /> <br /> I'm thinking about a Seer legacy using media and propaganda towards their nefarious ends, probably enchanting them with Compelling and Rulling magic to make them more... Penetrating on people's mind. The problem is... I'm not sure how to do it. <br /> <br /> So, the first thing I though was imbuing items with persistent effect, but I think this is too much complicated, requiring Prime 4 (Imbued Item attainment) to do the basic trick. <br /> <br /> So it raises questions: <br /> <br /> How to make a propaganda piece empowered with magic? <br /> <br /> If it's, for example... <br /> <br /> A poster? Using a rune to keep the effect running on it? What if I need to make them in mass production (considering runes need to be used in ritual casting, since they take ritual-long intervals to be drawn)<br /> <br /> A radio or tv broadcast? Would the effect travel along the waves towards the public? Or Prime+Forces would be required (Space maybe)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28637-hasura","name":"Hasura","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-22T19:50:28-08:00","id":1555782,"title":"","content":"This kind of thing is broadly outside the scope of Traveler Arcana to do in a more involved fashion than Basilisk Yantras (from Signs of Sorcery) to make functional short-Duration spells cast on large numbers of people with high Scale. The types of things that can accomplish this consistently are instead either archmagic or more exotic Mysteries to exploit. You might take cues from Give Me That (also from Signs) to accomplish the imposition of simple Conditions on people with a Weaving or Perfecting spell with a Reach effect that allows for finer control, but &quot;a singular spell to make the abstract experience of a piece of media propagate across an extended population&quot; is more in the realm of Dynamics spells in the &quot;viral meme&quot; mode or expression.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-23T03:44:52-08:00","id":1555792,"title":"","content":"I wonder if the 'Pygmalion Society' legacy from <i>Legacies: The Sublime</i> would be appropriate? That is, rather than trying to make magic propaganda directly, you have a group who magically help the creators of propaganda make better propaganda.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-23T10:48:45-08:00","id":1555804,"title":"","content":"With existing Legacies, you could use the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e?p=1058850#post1058850\">Bearers of the Eternal Voice</a> to be an incredible orator, or perhaps the <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1539342-the-polaris-league-an-acanthus-legacy-of-ambitious-businessmen\">Polaris League</a> to thrown vast amounts of resources at a marketing campaign and pull enough social strings to guarantee it reaches far.<br /> <br /> The <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e?p=1051458#post1051458\">Pygmalion Society</a> mentioned above would also be great, driving artists to make catchy creations, with subliminal messages carefuly woven in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 11-23-2025, 01:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}